```
ROLE: product_realist  VOTE: red
REAL_USE_CASE: No distinct production user; existing inference engines (vLLM v1 KV offload + APC, SGLang HiCache/RadixAttention, AttentionStore/CachedAttention) already implement gap-timed demote + prefetch for multi-turn sessions. The "agent inter-turn gap" framing is subsumed by Continuum's (2511.02230) KV-TTL idle-gap scheduling.
OPERATIONAL_SIGNIFICANCE: Microbenchmark-only. Real H100 PCIe (57.0 GB/s H2D, 53.5 GB/s D2H) moves an 8k Llama-3-8B KV (1049 MB) in ~18 ms; reactive fetch pays ~18.4 ms on resume, demote+prefetch pays ~0 ms — an 18 ms delta negligible vs multi-second agentic gaps. Effective serving capacity (resumes/s on PCIe) shows reactive strictly dominates for all realistic p_rr<1 (1.18× at p_rr=0.7, 1.43× at p_rr=0.4) because proactive prefetch wastes 1× KV of H2D bandwidth on every non-resuming session; at p_rr=1.0 the policies tie with zero throughput advantage. The L0's "fair-share PCIe under decode" pessimism was wrong (concurrent decode costs only -4.7%); the real tax is the policy's own bidirectional self-contention (~20-25% per direction, 40-46 GB/s vs 57 GB/s solo), which the design creates.
ADOPTION_BARRIER: [Mechanism already shipped in vLLM/SGLang/AttentionStore/Pensieve — no differentiation; Proactive prefetch burns PCIe on abandoned sessions (p_rr<1 dominates real traffic); TTFT win <20 ms is below human-perceptible and below network variance; Kill-corner crossover (kappa_crit) already derived by Meng et al. 2601.19910; Requires p_rr≈1 and gap ≥ fetch time, a narrow intersection not representative of bursty agentic workloads; No measurable effective-batch-size Pareto improvement over reactive fetch-on-demand]
RATIONALE: L1 measured real PCIe BW and prefill cost: H2D 57.0 GB/s, 8k KV fetch ~18.4 ms, prefill 36k tok/s (RESULTS.md E1-E3). Effective capacity table shows reactive ≥ demote+prefetch for all p_rr, strictly greater when p_rr<1 (E3 kill-corner). E4 mechanism-delta table finds "NONE. Identical mechanism" vs AttentionStore (Gao ATC24 2403.19708), Pensieve (2312.05516), SGLang HiCache, vLLM-v1, and Continuum (2511.02230) subsumes agent-gap framing. Meng/Lee/Wang (2601.19910) pre-empts the PCIe-contention kill-corner with kappa_crit. Gap sensitivity (E5) shows median ≥0.5 s hides fetch for both policies, yielding no material edge. Verdict: WEAKEN toward REFUTE; contribution collapses to a hardware-specific re-measurement of a known crossover plus a narrow bidirectional-contention note (RESULTS.md).
```
